[{"result":{"data":{"json":{"id":"1882","stub":{"id":"1882","section":"01. Aspen Acres to North New Lane","altname":"","river":"Weber","difficulty":"ItoIIplusstandoutIII","states":["USA-UTA"]},"primaryGaugeStatus":{"status":"below-recommended","latestReading":{"value":"369","dateTime":"2026-05-12T02:15:00.000Z","qualifier":"NORMAL"},"metric":"cfs","adjustedDifficulty":null},"pointOfInterests":[{"type":"put-in","description":"There is a road you can walk down to a bridge, At the bridge there are some stairs that take you down to the river. From this put in to the Smith and Morehouse creek Confluence I have encountered Barb wire fences across the river. Be on the look out!","id":"108053","location":{"latitude":"40.787623","longitude":"-111.134947"},"name":"Aspen Acres Put In","distance":"0","photoID":"SHToxo0rDr22T4gP2pnuH","difficulty":"N/A","approximate":false},{"type":"access","description":"An alternate put in location. I have been putting in on the South side of the road and going under the road in the culvert.    40.785072, -111.155704","id":"xectu3EHlvCki1r34wHSG","location":{"latitude":"40.78503","longitude":"-111.155685"},"name":"Smith and Morehouse Alternate put-in Skips Barbwire fences above.  ","distance":"1.33","photoID":"suOLqvR5GXmL4jNyQmdB5","difficulty":"N/A","approximate":false},{"type":"hazard","description":"This is a low bridge, In a kayak ( with the correct skills) you can catch the eddy on the right (north) side and squeeze under at 1400cfs and lower. The eddy is small. In a raft or Ik,  I would catch an eddy up higher and portage around it.","id":"T31eSIMHxt6PaBfRateQQ","location":{"latitude":"40.774451","longitude":"-111.194546"},"name":"Low Bridge","distance":"3.78","photoID":"sdnxMLEqGuSkv6mMYJ68B","difficulty":"N/A","approximate":false},{"type":"takeout","description":"This is an alternate take out. There is a small dirt road going to the River. Teh upstream side is private property but the downstream side is Mountain Regional Water Service Dist. property.","id":"0uTnUsxNrW7xyC5KyuGoZ","location":{"latitude":"40.735077","longitude":"-111.252027"},"name":"Alternate Take out","distance":"8.23","photoID":"3zxbI8csCO9FYQdTi9E3R","difficulty":"N/A","approximate":false},{"type":"takeout","description":"This is another Take out- portage at High water. I have taken out here and skipped the lower section of this run. Below here are a couple man made diversions. There is an Eddy undert the bridge on the right side (North) in the bushes, The left (south) side is moving fairly quick with not a lot of eddy service.","id":"xdkNbHSo968p7EqBeB1Pl","location":{"latitude":"40.730661","longitude":"-111.255095"},"name":"Another Take out,  Low Bridge, Pinion lane","distance":"8.6","photoID":"HjfFAkyXIYCLgIX3l5toN","difficulty":"N/A","approximate":false},{"type":"hazard","description":"This is a man made slide, it changes with levels, I have never ran it. low water the concrete has metal sticking up. At high flows it looks retentive.","id":"Wlc39zE6jxuK9oEweQesY","location":{"latitude":"40.727619","longitude":"-111.256357"},"name":"Medusa","distance":"8.88","photoID":"g6umeS4tzCezlOdL0W2I8","difficulty":"N/A","approximate":false},{"type":"takeout","description":null,"id":"113296","location":{"latitude":"40.716","longitude":"-111.281"},"name":"Take Out","distance":"9","photoID":null,"difficulty":"N/A","approximate":false}],"alerts":[{"id":"101253587","title":null,"post_date":"2018-05-18 04:00:00+00","detail":"Can't say I'd recommend putting in at Aspen Acres anymore. There are six fences, two that are naked barb wire nearly invisible from above, between AA and Smith and Morehouse. Yet none after SM so put in at SM for this mid section of the upper Weber. Enjoy the new WW park too!","user":{"name":"DAVID NIX"}},{"id":"101252415","title":null,"post_date":"2016-05-23 04:00:00+00","detail":"A small group of packrafters floated this on 5/18/16.\n\nI counted 6 barbed wire fences across the river during this float.\n\nYou can see 